f:218808","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"蒼瀬","creatorId":"vndb:s9849","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9849","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9849","name":"蒼瀬","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:218810","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"KIT","creatorId":"vndb:s17303","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17303","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17303","name":"KIT","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:218811","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"望月 侑","creatorId":"vndb:s17887","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17887","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17887","name":"望月侑","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:218812","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"薄迷","creatorId":"vndb:s23592","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23592","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23592","name":"薄迷","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:218815","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"アーサー石井","creatorId":"vndb:s24218","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24218","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24218","name":"アーサー石井","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:218816","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"あおいあいう","creatorId":"vndb:s30329","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s30329","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s30329","name":"葵藍兎(あおいあいう)","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:218817","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c114255","characterName":"八雲 一樹","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"120081","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"398107"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24261"],"vndbCharacterId":"c114255"},"originalCharacterName":"八雲 一樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Don't worry. If we all work together, we'll surely find a way.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Meet Yakumo Itsuki, the optimistic protagonist of the story. Itsuki is a man of duty and moral compass, qualities that allow him to go above and beyond when it comes to helping others. While his innate goodness is one of his strengths, it's a double-edged sword. His trusting nature makes him prone to deception, and he's also easily swayed by flattery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Itsuki has an aversion to heavy silences. When confronted with such moments, he feels compelled to fill the void with conversation, aiming to lift the mood. However, this tendency often leads others to view him as excessively optimistic or lacking a sense of urgency—criticisms he's well-acquainted with."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When it comes to leisure, Itsuki is a man of diverse tastes. He relishes outdoor activities like fishing and camping but is equally fond of gaming, be it digital or analog. He considers the experience of gaming in the great outdoors to be the pinnacle of luxury."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Above all, Itsuki is guided by the principle of collective well-being. He operates under the belief that there's always a way out of difficult situations. Sacrifices are not an option for him; he aims to ensure everyone makes it out unscathed."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114255"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前向きで義理堅く、他人のためにより力を発揮できる性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根は善良だが、それゆえに騙されやすかったり、おだてに弱いところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦手なものは重たい沈黙。そういう場面になると明るい空気を作ろうと口が動く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため楽観的だとか、緊張感が足りないという評価を受けやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は釣りやキャンプなどのアウトドアとゲーム（デジタル、アナログ問わず）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大自然の中でゲームをするのが最高の贅沢と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"犠牲を望まず、全員での脱出を目指して行動する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24261","sourceWorkId":"33209","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前向きで義理堅く、他人のためにより力を発揮できる性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根は善良だが、それゆえに騙されやすかったり、おだてに弱いところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦手なものは重たい沈黙。そういう場面になると明るい空気を作ろうと口が動く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため楽観的だとか、緊張感が足りないという評価を受けやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は釣りやキャンプなどのアウトドアとゲーム（デジタル、アナログ問わず）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大自然の中でゲームをするのが最高の贅沢と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"犠牲を望まず、全員での脱出を目指して行動する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"120081"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afb351ddc3d6577d42d30928ec52878258a10891ab910a63cb4d48cdfc52e2d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e661df70fcc7590051e67b43aa93d3c9da773224bb174e21bb6e5d804bfed6aa.webp","width":79,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c114435","characterName":"籠女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"119870","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"398107"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24253"],"vndbCharacterId":"c114435"},"originalCharacterName":"籠女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Welcome to 'The Hidden Realm,' a secluded sanctuary detached from the ephemeral world. Should you wish to depart, a choice awaits you—choose wisely.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kagome is a stunning young woman whom Itsuki encounters in Himeyoshi Village. With her striking white hair and deep red eyes, she is anything but ordinary. Kagome informs Itsuki that to leave the village, someone must become a 'human pillar' and stay behind, forcing Itsuki to make a consequential choice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she presents herself with a refined and composed demeanor, don't let it fool you; she has a wild, somewhat sadistic personality. One moment, she shows a delightful face, enjoying a pleasant conversation with Itsuki; the next, she's taking twisted pleasure in complicating his life. She appears out of nowhere, delivering enigmatic words and an alluring aura, only to disappear as suddenly as she appeared. What could her true identity and purpose be?"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In the spin-off, Kagome became the sacrifice so that Itsuki and the Earth Science Club could escape from the village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114435"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一樹が『姫香村』で出会う、真っ白な髪と赤い瞳をした美しい少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"村から出るには誰か一人が人柱となりこの村に残らなければならないと、一樹に選択を迫る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"丁寧で落ち着いた雰囲気と振る舞いだが、性格は奔放かつやや嗜虐的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"単に会話を楽しむような愛らしい顔を見せたと思えば、一樹を困らせて喜ぶ意地悪さも持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神出鬼没に現れ、意味深な言葉と妖しい色香を残して姿を消す。その正体と目的は……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24253","sourceWorkId":"33209","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一樹が『姫香村』で出会う、真っ白な髪と赤い瞳をした美しい少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"村から出るには誰か一人が人柱となりこの村に残らなければならないと、一樹に選択を迫る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"丁寧で落ち着いた雰囲気と振る舞いだが、性格は奔放かつやや嗜虐的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"単に会話を楽しむような愛らしい顔を見せたと思えば、一樹を困らせて喜ぶ意地悪さも持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神出鬼没に現れ、意味深な言葉と妖しい色香を残して姿を消す。その正体と目的は……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"119870"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"性格","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"119870","value":"奔放でやや嗜虐的。見た目よりはるかに落ち着いている。"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"ur